Per the endorsement wording (effective 2024-09-01):

Business Use (Class 1) does NOT extend to:
i. use as a taxi or hire vehicle;
ii. carrying goods for reward;
iii. use for racing, rallying, pace‑making, or speed testing;
iv. commercial travelling involving calling on multiple business premises as the primary purpose of each journey.

Who is covered for business use:
Only the policyholder (Catherine Whitmore) is covered for business use under this endorsement; Named Drivers are not covered.
